353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 53 0 R
/T (Re-Fashion is a sustainability analysis tool for the fashion industry, built as a semester 3 university project with a focus on functional depth and data-driven logic over visual design. It uses a hybrid ML + LLM architecture: a Gradient Boosting Regression model calculates an Eco Score from structured sustainability indicators such as carbon emissions, water usage, and labor metrics, while an LLM serves as the interface, letting users describe a product or brand in natural language, extracting the relevant parameters, and turning the numerical results into clear explanations and recommendations. The model is currently trained on a synthetic dataset modeled on realistic industry ranges, as brand-level sustainability data is fragmented and rarely public. The pipeline is designed to be retrained on real data without architectural changes. The app includes an Eco Score Calculator, a Product Sustainability Advisor with material recommendations, a Fast Fashion Impact Awareness section, a Conscious Shopping Assistant, and a chatbot for follow-up questions.)
/E (Re-Fashion is a sustainability analysis tool for the fashion industry, built as a semester 3 university project with a focus on functional depth and data-driven logic over visual design. It uses a hybrid ML + LLM architecture: a Gradient Boosting Regression model calculates an Eco Score from structured sustainability indicators such as carbon emissions, water usage, and labor metrics, while an LLM serves as the interface, letting users describe a product or brand in natural language, extracting the relevant parameters, and turning the numerical results into clear explanations and recommendations. The model is currently trained on a synthetic dataset modeled on realistic industry ranges, as brand-level sustainability data is fragmented and rarely public. The pipeline is designed to be retrained on real data without architectural changes. The app includes an Eco Score Calculator, a Product Sustainability Advisor with material recommendations, a Fast Fashion Impact Awareness section, a Conscious Shopping Assistant, and a chatbot for follow-up questions.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
