412 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (I've always believed that learning doesn't only happen inside a classroom. Since high school, I've learned the importance of being active outside of class, starting with joining committees and helping run school events, then joining Youth in Mission, traveling as far as Singkawang and Rote Island to volunteer in local schools, churches, and orphanages. Those trips took me far outside my comfort zone and taught me how to connect with people whose lives looked completely different from mine. Carrying that same spirit into university, I joined KBMK Binus, where I grew from being a student activist in the Design and Social Media division to becoming Vice Coordinator, serving a community that extends beyond campus through temple visits, orphanage outreach, and seminars.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
