876 0 obj
<<
/Title (Picking the right song shouldn't take longer than actually listening to it. So I built TuneCafe for myself: a desktop music player styled like a miniature iPod, where I just pick a drink and my playlist starts playing instantly. No browsing, no searching, no decisions. Each drink maps to a mood and a playlist I already love, so every song that plays is one I'd actually listen to. It's part personal tool, part aesthetic object, something that sits on my screen and makes my setup feel a little more like my own.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 473 0 R
/Prev 1232 0 R
/First 1233 0 R
/Last 1234 0 R
/Count -9
>>
endobj
